    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63068" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λῐβυστικόν</span></b> , τό, a
		herb, <i><span class="en">
			Gal.
			6.267
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			12.62
		</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λῐβυστιάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, <i><span class="en">
			Androm.
		</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
			Gal.
			14.40
		</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λῐβυστικᾶτον</span></b> , τό, a drink made
		from it, <i><span class="en">
			Alex.Trall.
			8.2
		</span></i>. [Identical with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λιγυστικόν</span>,
		q.v.]</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
